  data: {
    LLM: '1. Must follow suit. If unable, must trump if possible.\n2. **Bella**: Playing the King and Queen of trumps scores 20 points (must be announced).\n3. **Meld**: Sequences of 3 (20 pts) or 4 (50 pts) in the same suit score. Only the highest meld on either side scores for the team.\n4. **Last Trick**: 10 points.',
    Player: '1. Must follow suit. If unable, must trump if possible.\n2. **Bella**: Playing the King and Queen of trumps scores 20 points (must be announced).\n3. **Meld**: Sequences of 3 (20 pts) or 4 (50 pts) in the same suit score. Only the highest meld on either side scores for the team.\n4. **Last Trick**: 10 points.',
    objective: 'Score 500 points by winning tricks containing point cards and declaring melds.',
    gameplay: '1. Must follow suit. If unable, must trump if possible.\n2. **Bella**: Playing the King and Queen of trumps scores 20 points (must be announced).\n3. **Meld**: Sequences of 3 (20 pts) or 4 (50 pts) in the same suit score. Only the highest meld on either side scores for the team.\n4. **Last Trick**: 10 points.',
